# go
*.qtpl.go
# A bare `go build` (no -o) emits a binary named after the module, e.g.
# svc_ip_api - a ~20MB ELF that must never be committed. The Dockerfile always
# builds with -o /dist/..., so this only ever catches a stray local build.
/svc_*

